{"id": "C2-19:7", "en": "For the avoidance of doubt, this agreement does not transfer ownership.", "p": [["KALIP", "For the avoidance of doubt", "şüpheye yer bırakmamak için"], ["S", "this agreement", "bu anlaşma"], ["V", "does not transfer", "devretmez"], ["O", "ownership", "mülkiyeti"]]}
